                              design, and its own README says so: extracted
                              from arrangement, `whose arrangement.core
                              interleaved this query half with a persistence
                              half`.
      kotoba-lang/datom       representation only. No conn, no transact.
      kotoba-lang/kotobase    open / transact! / q / pull, on the DURABLE
